OL,3,GNEWSACouple charged over Syndey
OL,4,Aketamine raid face new gang charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Edinburgh couple charged over drug
OL,7,Foffences in Australia after 107kg of
OL,8,Fketamine was seized have now also been
OL,9,Fcharged with being part of a criminal
OL,10,Fgang.
OL,12,FDemi McDaid, 23, and her partner Jack
OL,13,FFarrelly, 30, were arrested in a Sydney
OL,14,Fhotel at the end of June after police
OL,15,Ffound 105kg of the drug in a car parked
OL,16,Fat the accommodation.
OL,18,FThey appeared before Sydney's Downing
OL,19,FCentre Local Court where they were both
OL,20,Fcharged with one count of participating
OL,21,Fin a criminal group contributing to
OL,22,Fcriminal activity.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
